# Portable artifact mappings. Copy to `drive-map` at the ROOT of the brain and commit it.
# Format: <node path>|<path relative to the cloud artifact root>
#
# Node paths are relative to spaces/. Targets are resolved beneath the absolute root passed
# to link-drive.sh. Existing artifact folders must already exist; only explicit
# `--convention` mode creates folders.
#
# french|French class
# house/renovation|House/Renovation
